# Runtime and maintainer images need only the Go workspace, reusable modules,
# server, and hosted webapp. Everything else stays outside the build context so
# ignored operator/developer material cannot influence or reach the builder.
*
!go.work
!go.work.sum
!packages
!packages/**
!server
!server/**
!webapp
!webapp/**

# These patterns remain excluded even when they are nested below an included
# source directory.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.npmrc
**/.pnp
**/.pnp.js
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/.vercel
**/.vscode
**/.scratch
**/.scratch/**
**/.plans
**/.plans/**
**/tmp
**/tmp/**
**/legacy
**/legacy/**
**/tools
**/tools/**
**/*.pem
**/.DS_Store
**/node_modules
**/coverage
**/dist
**/out
**/npm-debug.log*
**/yarn-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*
server/config/config.json
